course: dictionary
lesson: 3602
title: Fifth: order or parts
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Fifth can mean a place in order, or one of five equal parts. Context tells you which. «A boy in England dropped a small bottle from a fifth-floor balcony» is about order: it is the floor that comes after the fourth.
explain: «About a fifth of the oil the world uses passes through the Strait of Hormuz» is about a fraction: one of five equal parts, written 1/5. To check, divide by 5. «One fifth of 20 is 20 ÷ 5 = 4.» Two fifths means two of those parts, written 2/5.
fact: Fifth means number 5 in order, such as the fifth floor.
fact: A fifth is one of 5 equal parts, written 1/5.
fact: Two fifths means two of those equal parts, written 2/5.
fact: «Fifth grade» (in the USA) is the school year for children about 10 to 11 years old.
fact: In music, a fifth is a kind of gap between notes.
exercise: «A boy in England dropped a small bottle from a fifth-floor balcony.» What does fifth-floor mean here? | The fifth-best floor in town | *The floor that comes fifth in order, after four floors | A floor with five windows | One fifth of the building
exercise: «Babies spend about half their sleep in REM, grown-ups only about a fifth.» What does a fifth mean here? | A fifth of a day, the morning | Five hours of sleep | *One of five equal parts, about 1/5 | Number five in order
exercise: One fifth of 20 is 20 ÷ 5 = ? | *4 | 3 | 10 | 5
test: «Two fifths» of a pizza means how many of the five equal parts? | Ten | One | *Two | Five
test: In a line of runners, Ana is fifth. How many runners come before her? | *Four | Three | Five | Six
exam: Which sentence uses fifth to mean one of five equal parts? | «Fifth grade starts in September.» | «She lives on the fifth floor.» | *«Only a fifth of the water was left in the tank.» | «The fifth bus was late.»
